  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1189887.svg\" alt=\"title\" width=\"386\" height=\"24\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Описание:</strong></span><strong><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/linear pipes/screen.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;Ресурспак, который меняет все модели блоков и текстуры любых труб от&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pipez</a>&nbsp;на более красивые и подходящие к <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mekanism</a>!</span></span></p><p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/image.gif?raw=true\" alt=\"desc\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/2.png?raw=true\" alt=\"desc\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Также в этот пак входят все предметы из <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a></span></p><p><br><img src=\"https://github.com/DevDyna/ContentArchive/blob/main/Pretty X Smart Pipez Mekanism Edition/screen/item.png?raw=true\" alt=\"desc\" width=\"915\" height=\"454\"><br><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Этот проект сочетает модели и текстуры из <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pretty-pipez-mekanism-edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pretty Pipez : Mekanism Edition</a> с логикой блоков из <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smart-pipez\" rel=\"nofollow\">Smart Pipez</a></span></p>",
